{"total":8118311,"comments":[{"id":11626580,"author":"Background Pony #8787","body":"Well, at least Flutters laughed. :p\r\n\r\nCome to think of it, Fluttershy appears to be the only one who's really paying close attention anyway. Pinkie's obviously goofing off, Rainbow's dozed off, Rarity's more focused on posing for the camera, and Applejack's listening but not really participating otherwise.","updated_at":"2026-11-02T19:45:58Z","created_at":"2026-11-02T19:45:58Z","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","user_id":null,"image_id":3925010,"edit_reason":null,"edited_at":null},{"id":11626579,"author":"Shatara","body":"I'm pretty sure battle saddles are at least semi-canonically one of the answers to the 'how do I gun with hooves' question, even if they don't explicitly show or describe them.","updated_at":"2026-11-02T19:45:25Z","created_at":"2026-11-02T19:45:25Z","avatar":"https://derpicdn.net/avatars/2015/10/14/11_54_25_761_Shatara_pantzar_av.png","user_id":332040,"image_id":3924390,"edit_reason":null,"edited_at":null}]}